<title>UK: Southern Peru Copper issuing $150 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Southern Peru Copper issuing $150 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Peru Ltd, guaranteed by Southern Copper Peru Corp, has launched a $150 million 10-year bond, lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No pricing details were made available.</p>
<p>The deal will be listed in Luxembourg and sold in denominations of $250,000.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
